OL,3,GNEWSALockerbie bombing suspect seized
OL,4,Afrom Libya in 'cloak and dagger'
OL,5,Aoperation
OL,6,
OL,7,FA Lockerbie bombing suspect has claimed
OL,8,Fhe was illegally removed from Libya to
OL,9,Fstand trial in the United States after
OL,10,F"a cloak and dagger operation conducted
OL,11,Fin the dead of night".
OL,13,FAbu Agila Mohammad Mas'ud Kheir
OL,14,FAl-Marimi has alleged he was abducted
OL,15,Fby armed men and handed over "hooded
OL,16,Fand bound" to FBI agents, who had a
OL,17,Fplane waiting to fly him out of the
OL,18,Fcountry.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
