OL,3,GNEWSALockerbie bombing suspect seized
OL,4,Afrom Libya in 'cloak and dagger'
OL,5,Aoperation
OL,6,
OL,7,FAl-Marimi, also known as Mas'ud, has
OL,8,Fdenied building and priming the bomb
OL,9,Fthat brought down Pan Am Flight 103
OL,10,Fover Lockerbie on 21 December 1988,
OL,11,Fkilling 270 people.
OL,13,FThe Libyan argues he was the victim of
OL,14,Fan unlawful rendition and has asked a
OL,15,Fjudge in Washington DC to throw the
OL,16,Fcase out of court.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
